title: With no file selected the find bar looks for files by name: a name found is counted, one that is not gives none, a capital makes it exact (smart case) as Match Case does, a regular expression changes what matches, and Enter walks the matches
folders: rust-small
limit: 50
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: script: ignoring
expect-log: script: find-files "steps" found 1\b
expect-log: script: find-files "zzzz" found 0\b
expect-log: (?-i)script: find-files "Steps" found 0\b
expect-log: (?-i)script: find-files "STEPS" found 0\b
expect-log: script: find-files "\\\\\.rs\$" found 3\b

wait 3000
fit
wait 800
find-files steps
wait 600
mark steps-found
wait 450
find next
wait 1500
mark steps-flown-to
wait 450
find-files zzzz
wait 600
mark none
wait 450
find-option case on
find-files Steps
wait 600
mark case-on-no-match
wait 450
find-option case off
find-files STEPS
wait 600
mark case-off-match
wait 450
find-option regex on
find-files \.rs$
wait 600
mark regex-three-files
wait 450
find next
wait 800
find next
wait 800
find previous
wait 1200
mark walked
wait 450
find close
wait 500
quit
